# The Vercel CLI tried to upload 2.7 GB for a site a few MB in size. The
# project .gitignore already excludes node_modules and .next, but the CLI,
# run from website/ inside the TapDesk repo, still walked into them (its root
# detection walks up to .git). This file is honored regardless of how the CLI
# resolves the project root: everything not needed to build the site is
# excluded, and the remote build installs its own dependencies.
node_modules
.next
.git
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
dev.log
README.md
